  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "MobileGameTimer",
      "description": "It is an application that efficiently manages the stamina of social games.\nThis app has the following features:\n\n- Multiple game management function\n  You can register multiple games for which you want to manage your stamina.\n- Notification function when the stamina is full or set value\n  Local notification is sent when the stamina is full or when the stamina is set value. Notification settings can be made from the OS Settings app.\n- Widget support\n  You can display the stamina of one game in the regular version and four games in the full version in the widget.\n  The initials of each game, current stamina, maximum stamina, approximate time to fill, and gauge graph are displayed, so if you place the widget on the home screen, lock screen and Apple Watch, you can check the recovery status of stamina without opening the game.\n- Apple Watch compatible(watchOS9 or later)\n  You can check your game status in the Apple Watch app. Place a complication on your watch face to see your stamina recovery at any time.",
      "releaseNotes": "- Design update \n- Internal operation improvement",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mobilegametimer/id1580269211?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
